# The RayNeo Mercury / IPC SDK AARs used to be tracked here on the belief
# that the app could not build without them. It can: nothing imports them,
# a clean build succeeds without them, and the app runs on the glasses.
# The launcher integration is three strings in AndroidManifest.xml and needs
# no library at all. They were removed rather than republished.
